+  point carries velocities and accelerations (no more ``[0.0] * 6``, which made
+  joint_trajectory_controller stop at every waypoint), scaled with the
+  velocity_scale;
+* the Pinocchio sim controller and the Isaac bridge follow the goal the way JTC
+  does: one-point goals start from the current pose (the sim used to teleport to
+  the target), and the Isaac stream lasts as long as the goal (it used to play a
+  50 ms segment in 40 ms).
+
